codex
The code has a few structural issues that matter more than local bugs: the GUI boundary is doing privileged filesystem operations directly, restore/rename flows are not transactional across subsystems, and the watcher manager has shared mutable state without a lock. I’m checking the exact call sites so the findings can be grounded in lines rather than broad modules.
